! C2H8O3 | Saddle Point Search | wB97X-D/6-21G+(d,p)
! Constraints REMOVED -- genuine, unconstrained saddle point search.
!
! aa001c was a CONSTRAINED optimization (IFZMAT distance restraints
! holding the incoming water 1.2 A from the hydrate), used to generate a
! good TS-like starting structure -- exactly mirroring how caa005b.log
! (chloroacetaldehyde's own constrained analogue) was used as the
! starting point for caa005bTSa.log's genuine saddle point search. This
! file follows the same pattern: same starting geometry, same $ZMAT
! internal-coordinate setup (DLC=.t. AUTO=.t., same NONVDW exclusions to
! keep the DLC generator from mistreating the close H-bonded contacts as
! ordinary non-bonded pairs), but with the IFZMAT/FVALUE constraint line
! removed entirely -- this is now a genuine RUNTYP=SADPOINT search, not a
! restrained minimisation.
!
! HESS=READ with the actual computed Hessian from aa001c.dat (the second,
! unlabeled $HESS block -- confirmed genuine and final by its position
! directly after the final $GRAD block, GMAX=0.0000493/GRMS=0.0000157,
! and confirmed NOT the "CAUTION, APPROXIMATE HESSIAN!" block that
! appeared earlier in the same file from an intermediate BFGS-updated
! step). Since aa001c correctly used $FORCE PURIFY=.T., this Hessian
! should already have translation/rotation cleanly removed.

 $BASIS GBASIS=N21 NGAUSS=6 NDFUNC=1 NPFUNC=1 DIFFSP=.t. $END
 $CONTRL SCFTYP=RHF RUNTYP=SADPOINT NZVAR=33 $END
 $CONTRL DFTTYP=wB97X-D $END
 $SCF DIIS=.t. DAMP=.t. $END
 $STATPT OPTTOL=0.00005 NSTEP=200 IHREP=20 HESS=READ
         HSSEND=.t. $END
 $ZMAT DLC=.t. AUTO=.t. $END
 $ZMAT NONVDW(1)=8,13, 10,7, 7,3, 8,10 $END
 $FORCE METHOD=SEMINUM PURIFY=.t. $END
 $PCM SOLVNT=WATER $END
 $SYSTEM MWORDS=25 MEMDDI=24 $END
!$CONTRL EXETYP=CHECK $END

 $DATA
Acetaldehyde hydrate and water -- saddle point search
C1
H     1.0   2.8629255881   0.5447124149  -0.3097793790
C     6.0   2.7344040330   0.1837247224  -1.3343231999
C     6.0   3.4400625009   1.1391419548  -2.2717788530
O     8.0   2.8874499391   2.4165693689  -2.3134222434
H     1.0   1.6631589796   0.1544777745  -1.5559290222
H     1.0   3.1605550184  -0.8201477561  -1.4074652117
O     8.0   3.3298619051   0.5338989118  -3.7552096293
O     8.0   3.5369532017   2.7146087853  -4.5393890555
H     1.0   3.0586240062   3.1459953016  -5.2524943044
H     1.0   3.4341044144   1.5339814351  -4.4101664568
H     1.0   2.4964554157   0.0582407559  -3.8802850721
H     1.0   4.5265718503   1.1290890462  -2.1706636249
H     1.0   3.1791473805   2.8315845701  -3.3999630333
 $END
